{"id":"n25123-1-7","stage":4,"title":"전기 · 前期","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25123-1-7-1","ko":"조선 전기와 후기를 나누는 기준이 뭐야?","zh":"朝鲜时代的早期和晚期是以什么为分界线的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조선","meaning":"朝鲜王朝","explanation":"조선：朝鲜王朝","readings":[{"term":"조선","audio":"/audio/704eb7f395d4492f24d6.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조선","audio":"/audio/704eb7f395d4492f24d6.mp3"}},{"text":"전기와","meaning":"前期","explanation":"전기：前期；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"전기","audio":"/audio/8cd58eab1de8b2f5285f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25123","senseId":"1","lemma":"전기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전기와","audio":"/audio/7cd68d8d82f633382b99.mp3"}},{"text":"후기를","meaning":"后期","explanation":"후기：后期；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"후기","audio":"/audio/1b5b7f9e7a75d73e6c90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89385","senseId":"1","lemma":"후기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후기를","audio":"/audio/d9d0134346243a388ab9.mp3"}},{"text":"나누는","meaning":"分类，区分","explanation":"나누다：分类，区分；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"2","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나누는","audio":"/audio/645b535baaf426971834.mp3"}},{"text":"기준이","meaning":"标准，基准","explanation":"기준：标准，基准；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기준","audio":"/audio/eaea55bff60093748aab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61091","senseId":"1","lemma":"기준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기준이","audio":"/audio/7359a787bac0fc28d528.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audi